 date depends on how quickly the bugs reported during this period get fixed. So if you run into any issue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T01:25:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4733470-1846651706686284","game_id":"steam-4733470","kind":"update","title":"Infinite Loop Demo Update — Oct 18, 2026","summary":"Improved📖 All map names and descriptions have been rewritten with richer worldbuilding (CN/EN/JP synchronized)🖥️ Various UI text refinementsFixed🛠 Fixed the \"skill bar full\" message displaying an internal code name instead of the skill nameThanks for playing — join our community and share your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:31:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686284","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4733470-1846018067932237","game_id":"steam-4733470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 10.9","summary":"NewBrand-new \"Portrait\" system: from the title screen, upload your own images to create a custom character portrait — with frame-by-frame animation for Idle / Move / Death, and save multiple portraits to switch, preview, or delete anytimeFixedFixed a case where a skill's level could display incorrectly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T05:54:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932237","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4733470-1846018067928182","game_id":"steam-4733470","kind":"upda